# Set up the project

Create `trellis.toml`, a native IDL source, and a language manifest.

```toml
[project]
name = "orders-service"
```

```text
orders-service/
├── contract.trellis
├── trellis.toml
├── deno.json
└── src/
```

Run `trellis update` after changing dependencies and `trellis generate` after changing IDL. Generated files live under `.trellis/artifacts`, `.trellis/ts`, and `.trellis/rust`; do not edit them.
